Subtracting $(M)$ from $(A_1)$: $\;\tfrac{1755}{16} + \tfrac{21D}{4} + 3E = 0$, so $E = -\tfrac{585}{16} - \tfrac{7D}{4}$.

Subtracting $(P)$ from $(M)$ and substituting $E$ yields $D = -\tfrac{129}{8}$, then $E = -\tfrac{267}{32}$, $F = \tfrac{585}{8}$.

