$$R^2 = \left(\tfrac{129}{16}\right)^2 + \left(\tfrac{267}{64}\right)^2 - \tfrac{585}{8} = \tfrac{16641}{256} + \tfrac{71289}{4096} - \tfrac{299520}{4096} = \tfrac{266256 + 71289 - 299520}{4096} = \tfrac{38025}{4096}.$$

